                <p>
                    Unnecessary or insecure services such as
                    Telnet can increase the attack surface of
                    network devices.
                </p>

            </div>


            <div class="problem-card">

                <div class="problem-icon">🔐</div>

                <h3>Weak Security Controls</h3>

